{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"周守仁籲各堂區於大火一周年當日　舉行亡者奉獻彌撒\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/WF-CHOU-261113-22.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】天主教香港教區主教周守仁樞機，呼籲各堂區在宏福苑火災一周年當日為亡者奉獻彌撒。</p><p>周守仁向各堂區及信仰團體負責人發信，呼籲在本月26日火災一周年當日為亡者奉獻彌撒，亦在隨後主日彌撒中加入相關祈禱意向。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T15:23:35.557048+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T14:35:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T07:35:22.039610+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T15:17:00.226820+00:00","content_hash":"cb36545d465faf6f97e5893e5a47f0ac9fcd61734a4c2cf44a35261c27deb663","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}